
Pi Invest OS — local AI agent on this Raspberry Pi
==================================================
Runs solely on-device after first boot (Ollama + paper + simulator):
  • Graphical desktop (Wayland / labwc) with autologin
  • ollama.service                 (local LLM on :11434)
  • pi-invest.service              (paper trading loop)
  • pi-invest-dashboard.service    (local app backend)
  • Desktop app:  Pi Invest        (menu / Desktop icon — not a web URL)
  • GitHub auto-update             OFF (local-only)

Open the app: click "Pi Invest" on the Desktop, or run:  pi-invest app

Secrets: edit /boot/firmware/pi-invest.env before first boot
         or /opt/pi-invest-agent/.env after login.

Local AI setup: sudo pi-invest-setup-local-ai.sh
Status:         pi-invest status
Login: user `pi` (password change-me — change it)
Docs:  /opt/pi-invest-agent/README.md  and  /etc/pi-invest-os-release
